    "turn_idx": 1,
    "turn_text": "Well, Barry, right now, the first time in fifty years that the microphone of the president of the president senate and of the speaker of the house is all in republican control there are no checks and balances in washington uh... the democratic party has been relegated to a minority party uh... it is treated by the press is such it uh... they can sort of ignore uh... democrats and that's why you hear people think where the democratic party we don't hear from you we don't see you well that we couldn't get a room scheduled in the Capitol without the consent of the Republicans.",
