    "turn_idx": 3,
    "turn_text": "The Republican leadership's in charge and they decide what bills will be heard. They will decide what witnesses will be called. They'll decide what questions will be asked. They'll decide when a vote It's going to be taken in committee to pass the bill out or because we don't take votes on any bill if it's going to die. They decide the entire agenda of what we're going to hear, what we're going to ask questions of, and when votes will be scheduled on the floor and whether or not any amendments can be made to those votes.",
