    "turn_idx": 49,
    "turn_text": "Well that gets to the very basic point which I think is we need to revisit this country is that democracy only works with a participatory electorate. and so often elected i think has been able to be relatively satisfied the government taking care of their needs and uh... things they objected to they could usually find a outlet in congress to uh... get that that opinion expressed in many cases get the political uh... powers to stop uh... stop evil",
